 {
  "key": "waves.properties.c07",
  "cardType": "CONCEPT",
  "front": "Transverse vs longitudinal waves?",
  "back": "Transverse: vibrations at right angles to travel (light, water waves, S-waves). Longitudinal: vibrations parallel to travel (sound, P-waves).",
